      "target": "An **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM INFANTRY** unit of yours that is up to 6\" from at least one enemy unit it could charge.",
      "effect": "The unit can now declare a charge. If it does, it can only pick those enemy units as its charge targets, and it gets no Charge bonus for the rest of the turn. Melee attacks by the models of a **CALLIDUS ASSASSIN** unit that made its [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move) through this Stratagem get +1 to [Wound](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls) for the rest of the turn."
